{
  "_comment": "Default Slidesmith theme. A design-token source of truth (primitives -> light mode -> semantic). `order` applies sets in sequence: primitives define literals, later sets reference them with {token} refs that resolve at CSS runtime via var(). Compile to design/brand.css with `python engine/tokens_to_css.py design/tokens.json design/brand.css`. This is a builder / developer-tool palette (deep terminal ink, an emerald signal accent, cool paper, a build-blue secondary) provided as an appealing, ready-to-use default; swap the values here to re-theme every slide at once without touching any code. Typeface is Sora (shipped as an embedded @font-face asset).",
  "order": ["primitives", "modes/light", "semantic"],
  "sets": {
    "primitives": [
      ["color.paper.100", "color", "#FBFBF9"],
